<TR><TD COLSPAN="8"><FONT POINT-SIZE="16">140 state variables (70 active + 70 inactive) · 70 activation reactions · 70 inactivation reactions · 103 activator modifiers · 3 inhibitor modifiers</FONT></TD></TR>
